lls and Martial Arts (or Assassin if evil) three. || MONEY: 2D6x100 credits; the relics and the artifact are a restriction line. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: the medium and large containers and plastic bags, 1D4+2 large pieces of white chalk, a can of fluorescent spray paint, 1D4 waterproof sacks, a 20-foot spool of wire, two demolition charges, nine climbing spikes/pitons, the hammer and chisel, four heavy iron spikes, an ice pick, a brush and other excavation tools, a block and tackle, a folding utility knife, a dozen chemical lights, multi-optics goggles, a portable or pocket computer for a character with a Computer skill, and the weapons (one per W.P. with 1D4 E-Clips each, and one likely pre-Rifts weapon). They are in GM Notes."
